{
  "about": "The approved sources of the staircase drafter's training data (Q20). Every prompt, answer, dump, vocabulary, pack, head and store must trace back to an entry here; check_sources.py is the gate that enforces it, and clean_prompts.py builds prompts from these entries only. Nothing is added without the owner's approval (the date per entry).",
